  m_Text: 'Slimes have been around for a long time. We are not afraid of them, because
    they are not very dangerous and never attack in packs. Until now...



    We
    have discovered that the Slimes have evolved. But do not be alarmed.



    We
    only know that they have become more aggressive and tend to change color.



    Either
    way, the scouts detected a horde of slimes approaching. You must prepare.'
